WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:06.000
If she feeds you because it's dinnertime, that's a routine.

2
00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:11.225
If she worries because you're late, that's fear.

3
00:00:12.025 --> 00:00:16.500
If she tells you to wear a coat, that's habit.

4
00:00:17.325 --> 00:00:27.900
But if she still saves you the last piece, years after you've left, without saying a word, that's a mother.

5
00:00:28.725 --> 00:00:30.900
Routines change.

6
00:00:31.750 --> 00:00:34.525
Fear passes when you call.

7
00:00:35.350 --> 00:00:37.850
Habits fade with time.

8
00:00:38.675 --> 00:00:44.800
That last piece was never about food, so it never stopped.

9
00:00:45.625 --> 00:00:47.525
Call her today.
